# Dolibarr language file - Source file is en_US - euvatlookup
ModuleEuVatLookupName = EU VAT Lookup
EuVatLookupDescription = Check an EU VAT number on VIES and fill the third party form
EuVatLookupDescriptionLong = Adds a button next to the VAT number on the third party form. The VAT number is checked on the official EU VIES service and the company name, address, zip, town and country are filled in the form. Empty fields are filled, fields with a different value are only changed after confirmation. Nothing is saved until you click Save.
EuVatLookupButton = Check VIES and fill
EuVatLookupChecking = Checking VAT number on VIES...
EuVatLookupValid = VAT number is valid (VIES)
EuVatLookupNotValid = VAT number is not valid or not registered in VIES
EuVatLookupServiceError = VIES service is not available or did not answer. Try again later.
EuVatLookupNoData = VAT number is valid but VIES does not publish company data for this country.
EuVatLookupFilled = Filled:
EuVatLookupAlreadyUpToDate = The form already contains the same data.
EuVatLookupDifferences = These fields already contain a different value. Tick the ones you want to replace:
EuVatLookupField = Field
EuVatLookupCurrent = Current value
EuVatLookupFromVies = Value from VIES
EuVatLookupOverwrite = Replace
EuVatLookupApplySelected = Replace selected
EuVatLookupNotSavedYet = Nothing is saved yet. Check the data and click Save.
EuVatLookupDuplicates = Warning, a third party with this VAT number already exists:
EuVatLookupFieldName = Name
EuVatLookupFieldAddress = Address
EuVatLookupFieldZip = Zip
EuVatLookupFieldTown = Town
EuVatLookupFieldCountry = Country
EuVatLookupFieldVat = VAT number
EuVatLookupEnterVat = Enter a VAT number first (for example SI12345678).
